---
manual: events.click
lines: [2187, 2193]
testability: interactive
display: native
ledger: E8
----------- app code
# An image's click block runs once per click, on the press, as every drawable's does.
$clicks = []
Shoes.app width: 200, height: 120 do
  image "assets/red-40x30.png", left: 20, top: 20 do |button, left, top|
    $clicks << [button, left, top]
  end
end
----------- test code
click_at 30, 30
assert_equal [[1, 30, 30]], $clicks, "one click, one run of the image's block"
